Package: treeFA
Type: Package
Title: Tree-Guided Feature Aggregation
Version: 0.0.2
Author: Jinwen Fu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jinwen Fu <jinwen@example.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jinwen", "Fu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jinwen@example.com")
  )
Description: Fits tree-guided feature aggregation models for linear and binary
    outcomes using a direct tree penalty. The main linear proximal-gradient
    solver is implemented in C++. Separate Davis-Yin splitting interfaces
    jointly aggregate and select features with an additional L1 penalty,
    including two-parameter paths and cross-validation.
